{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Simulator: Chinese Restaurant is now open for business \u2014 Simple Cards, Tasty Success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/0dcfcaf52e070d06f9362fec3cce9de6.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/5c37b7e34b0dfa7cd5db6cf91ee5e1e2.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With just a simple drag and tap, transform a variety of ingredient cards into mouthwatering Chinese dishes. Dozens of classic recipes are waiting to be discovered, each designed to satisfy different customer tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dozens of ingredients and over a hundred unique recipes, you\u2019ll unlock and master traditional Chinese cuisine one dish at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/89784486d67e51f1dcf287e7eac0f758.poster.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/89784486d67e51f1dcf287e7eac0f758.webm?t=1774415647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/89784486d67e51f1dcf287e7eac0f758.mp4?t=1774415647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/0f3283a491a988701915b0367180fda7.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your customers happy, don\u2019t let them leave \u201changry\u201d! Manage cooking times carefully so every guest walks out with a smile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/14275fd84efa8028bae57479d2c102cb.poster.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/14275fd84efa8028bae57479d2c102cb.webm?t=1774415647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/14275fd84efa8028bae57479d2c102cb.mp4?t=1774415647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offering too many dishes isn\u2019t always better. Plan your daily menu wisely to maximize profits and run your restaurant efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/79d4910850bfb98d4c9703c414493658.poster.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/79d4910850bfb98d4c9703c414493658.webm?t=1774415647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/79d4910850bfb98d4c9703c414493658.mp4?t=1774415647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/c65ac27cbbde2ccff3729ad63fc4c497.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your signature dishes to unlock special bonuses. Turn every plate into a customer favorite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/54e49a59bbb2f892d7aa94d86ed33176.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinvest your earnings to expand your restaurant, upgrade kitchen equipment, and improve the d\u00e9cor. Watch your humble eatery transform into a popular dining destination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/6915da05bdaddb14ab060309249a62f5.poster.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/6915da05bdaddb14ab060309249a62f5.webm?t=1774415647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/6915da05bdaddb14ab060309249a62f5.mp4?t=1774415647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastered every recipe? Then step into the Culinary Competition! Win prestige, earn rewards, and make your restaurant known far and wide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/b548881c4add4e507a1265bc372b1c9e.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/4a463eb459386a8ca251861019d2154d.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Food lovers, your table is ready at <i>Card Simulator: Chinese Restaurant</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More exciting mechanics, surprise events, and hidden gameplay features are waiting for you to discover!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple Cards, Tasty Success! See you in the kitchen!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3978850?t=1774415647","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/effda868ba4559732c781e8c3584b8d2682943f9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774415647","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/6cbb385e434bd8d7c54d5ace23f758ee014cce42/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774415647","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/6cbb385e434bd8d7c54d5ace23f758ee014cce42/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774415647","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4034010,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Card Simulator: Chinese Restaurant is now open for business \u2014 Simple Cards, Tasty Success!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/0dcfcaf52e070d06f9362fec3cce9de6.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1560 height=504 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/5c37b7e34b0dfa7cd5db6cf91ee5e1e2.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With just a simple drag and tap, transform a variety of ingredient cards into mouthwatering Chinese dishes. Dozens of classic recipes are waiting to be discovered, each designed to satisfy different customer tastes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With dozens of ingredients and over a hundred unique recipes, you\u2019ll unlock and master traditional Chinese cuisine one dish at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/89784486d67e51f1dcf287e7eac0f758.poster.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/89784486d67e51f1dcf287e7eac0f758.webm?t=1774415647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/89784486d67e51f1dcf287e7eac0f758.mp4?t=1774415647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/0f3283a491a988701915b0367180fda7.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your customers happy, don\u2019t let them leave \u201changry\u201d! Manage cooking times carefully so every guest walks out with a smile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/14275fd84efa8028bae57479d2c102cb.poster.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/14275fd84efa8028bae57479d2c102cb.webm?t=1774415647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/14275fd84efa8028bae57479d2c102cb.mp4?t=1774415647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offering too many dishes isn\u2019t always better. Plan your daily menu wisely to maximize profits and run your restaurant efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/79d4910850bfb98d4c9703c414493658.poster.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/79d4910850bfb98d4c9703c414493658.webm?t=1774415647\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/79d4910850bfb98d4c9703c414493658.mp4?t=1774415647\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/c65ac27cbbde2ccff3729ad63fc4c497.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1560 height=505 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your signature dishes to unlock special bonuses. Turn every plate into a customer favorite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/54e49a59bbb2f892d7aa94d86ed33176.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reinvest your earnings to expand your restaurant, upgrade kitchen equipment, and improve the d\u00e9cor. Watch your humble eatery transform into a popular dining destination!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3978850/extras/6915da05bdaddb14ab060309249a62f5.poster.avif?t=1774415647\" width=1170 heigh